      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im kinda worried lately. i've been having these weird moments where i just suddenly get super confused and i cant find even simple words for stuff. like i'll be talking and just blank out for a few mins. could this just be like bad brain fog from stress or not getting enough sleep? i've been working a lot lately.",
